Cell["\<\
Sometimes (for example, when computing matrix representations by tensor \
product method) definition of full basis is not necessary. The option allows \
to define partial basis.\
\>", "Text",
 Editable->True,
 TaggingRules->{},
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.953987831531402*^9, 3.953987862547078*^9}, {
