Cell["\<\
The option \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]DefineInput\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] specify \
if input aliases should be in addition defined. The input aliases allows \
convenient input of basis elements by hand (this is default).  The option \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]MakeAlias\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] specify if the \
defined basis should be assigned to gaOrthonormalBasis[ ] container for \
further reference. \
\>", "Text",
 Editable->True,
 TaggingRules->{},
